1
00:00:01,350 --> 00:00:03,312
Levi and the Scouts clashed
with Kenny's squad,

2
00:00:03,337 --> 00:00:06,454
charging straight
into their defense.

3
00:00:06,940 --> 00:00:09,900
All to reach and rescue Eren and Historia.

4
00:00:11,070 --> 00:00:12,070
However...

5
00:00:19,910 --> 00:00:21,950
Fall back to the final defensive post!

6
00:00:22,120 --> 00:00:23,490
Time to regroup!

7
00:00:24,500 --> 00:00:26,880
I'm praying, Historia.

8
00:00:27,130 --> 00:00:30,550
For God to lead and guide humanity!

9
00:00:32,510 --> 00:00:33,920
God, my ass!

10
00:00:34,010 --> 00:00:37,550
You're just giving yourself an out
and manipulating other people!

11
00:00:37,680 --> 00:00:41,130
I've had it! I won't let you kill me!

12
00:00:42,140 --> 00:00:43,850
That's the spirit!

13
00:00:43,930 --> 00:00:45,350
This is gettin' good!

14
00:00:45,810 --> 00:00:47,689
You escape from here.

15
00:00:47,690 --> 00:00:49,730
I'll destroy everything else!

16
00:00:50,610 --> 00:00:51,900
Father...

17
00:00:52,480 --> 00:00:53,570
Uri...

18
00:00:54,240 --> 00:00:55,240
Frieda...

19
00:00:55,860 --> 00:00:56,970
Wait for me...

20
00:00:57,950 --> 00:00:59,050
...now...

21
00:02:35,000 --> 00:02:40,010
"Outside the Walls of Orvud District"

22
00:02:47,930 --> 00:02:50,880
It's gotta be a way through
if it's all plugged up.

23
00:02:51,440 --> 00:02:52,440
Shit.

24
00:02:52,520 --> 00:02:54,720
If only we had some gunpowder left...

25
00:02:55,690 --> 00:02:57,440
We cannot let them through!

26
00:02:58,400 --> 00:03:00,390
As long as we hold here, we're good!

27
00:03:06,200 --> 00:03:07,060
That's...

28
00:03:07,200 --> 00:03:08,200
A Titan transformed?

29
00:03:08,620 --> 00:03:09,620
Eren!

30
00:03:22,760 --> 00:03:24,850
Here it comes! Hang on tight!

31
00:03:29,270 --> 00:03:31,400
Th-This place is gonna collapse!

32
00:03:35,650 --> 00:03:37,190
Captain!

33
00:03:37,360 --> 00:03:38,360
The hole!

34
00:03:41,780 --> 00:03:45,660
Armin! Moblit! Take Hange
and get the hell out of here!

35
00:03:48,740 --> 00:03:50,369
Rod Reiss!

36
00:03:50,370 --> 00:03:52,160
You bastard!

37
00:03:52,410 --> 00:03:54,079
Forget it, Historia!

38
00:03:54,080 --> 00:03:58,710
Since that Titan's from the Reiss family,
just let him come and eat me!

39
00:03:58,750 --> 00:04:00,379
Get out of here!

40
00:04:00,380 --> 00:04:01,220
Hell no!

41
00:04:01,221 --> 00:04:02,970
Why won't you listen?!

42
00:04:03,340 --> 00:04:06,720
I might be humanity's
enemy, but I'm your ally!

43
00:04:08,100 --> 00:04:11,519
I can't be a good girl,
and I don't wanna be God either!

44
00:04:11,520 --> 00:04:12,520
But...

45
00:04:12,560 --> 00:04:16,210
When I see people crying to themselves,
saying they're not needed...

46
00:04:16,480 --> 00:04:19,020
...I wanna tell those people
that's just not true!

47
00:04:19,980 --> 00:04:22,630
No matter who! No matter where!

48
00:04:23,530 --> 00:04:25,490
I'll come to their rescue!

49
00:04:30,160 --> 00:04:31,160
Historia!

50
00:04:33,160 --> 00:04:34,160
You okay?

51
00:04:34,250 --> 00:04:35,300
Mikasa!

52
00:04:38,710 --> 00:04:39,710
Give me the keys!

53
00:04:39,840 --> 00:04:42,050
Captain? You guys...

54
00:04:45,760 --> 00:04:46,860
Conny, hurry!

55
00:04:47,430 --> 00:04:48,759
Forget about me!

56
00:04:48,760 --> 00:04:50,679
Captain! Hurry and escape!

57
00:04:50,680 --> 00:04:53,060
Shut up already, you topless wimp!

58
00:04:53,430 --> 00:04:56,980
It's not just a Titan!
There're dudes with guns coming for us!

59
00:04:58,020 --> 00:04:59,020
He's loose!

60
00:05:00,980 --> 00:05:01,980
I think...

61
00:05:02,230 --> 00:05:04,990
That's way bigger than
the Colossal Titan, isn't it?

62
00:05:08,160 --> 00:05:10,240
The ceiling...? Look out!

63
00:05:11,240 --> 00:05:12,240
Get back!

64
00:05:19,460 --> 00:05:23,510
Hey, hey, Rod! Ya done goofed up big time!

65
00:05:23,840 --> 00:05:27,089
You thought ya knew Titans
more than the rest of us!

66
00:05:27,090 --> 00:05:29,680
Now I know you didn't, ya dumb shit!

67
00:05:30,300 --> 00:05:31,390
Captain Ackermann!

68
00:05:32,010 --> 00:05:33,140
Idiots! Get away!

69
00:05:37,810 --> 00:05:40,030
Shit! There's no way out!

70
00:05:41,940 --> 00:05:42,940
Why?

71
00:05:43,650 --> 00:05:45,860
Wasn't he going to eat me?

72
00:05:49,110 --> 00:05:50,510
Should I transform?

73
00:05:51,580 --> 00:05:55,080
No... My Titan can't withstand all this...

74
00:06:01,790 --> 00:06:04,030
I'm sorry, everyone...

75
00:06:08,760 --> 00:06:11,370
I've been nothing but useless...

76
00:06:12,140 --> 00:06:17,390
Ever since the very beginning,
I was never the hope of humanity...

77
00:06:22,110 --> 00:06:23,230
Armor?

78
00:06:24,320 --> 00:06:27,070
What's this? Think you're some tragic hero?

79
00:06:27,820 --> 00:06:32,029
When have you ever accomplished
anything by your strength alone?

80
00:06:32,030 --> 00:06:33,310
What a weakling.

81
00:06:33,700 --> 00:06:36,079
We've been through much worse than this.

82
00:06:36,080 --> 00:06:38,120
Not that I wanna get used to it!

83
00:06:38,910 --> 00:06:42,810
Still, it's going to suck trying
to navigate through all that.

84
00:06:43,710 --> 00:06:44,840
I'll take Eren.

85
00:06:45,750 --> 00:06:49,509
We can't go nice and slow for you,
so hold on for your life.

86
00:06:49,510 --> 00:06:50,510
Right.

87
00:06:51,010 --> 00:06:53,720
It's useless. We can't escape.

88
00:06:54,050 --> 00:06:55,509
So do nothing?

89
00:06:55,510 --> 00:06:59,350
You wanna sit here and hold hands
till we're crushed or burn to death?

90
00:06:59,730 --> 00:07:01,800
Because we're enemies of humanity?

91
00:07:03,610 --> 00:07:07,010
You know, I hate doing this
to you every time, but...

92
00:07:07,610 --> 00:07:08,610
Eren.

93
00:07:09,860 --> 00:07:11,540
You've gotta make the choice.

94
00:07:16,410 --> 00:07:17,910
I'll go with you!

95
00:07:25,790 --> 00:07:26,790
Eren!

96
00:07:27,420 --> 00:07:28,450
I'm sorry...

97
00:07:29,470 --> 00:07:33,510
Since it's the end, just this once...
I want you to let me...

98
00:07:34,890 --> 00:07:37,070
Let me believe in myself!

99
00:07:57,200 --> 00:07:59,159
What... the...?

100
00:07:59,160 --> 00:08:01,410
Everyone! Get underneath Eren!

101
00:08:06,420 --> 00:08:07,420
Caven!

102
00:08:26,310 --> 00:08:27,470
The chapel!

103
00:08:35,240 --> 00:08:36,279
Not good!

104
00:08:36,280 --> 00:08:37,780
Let's try to run!

105
00:08:47,420 --> 00:08:49,360
Section Commander! Are you okay?!

106
00:08:49,880 --> 00:08:51,339
Yeah...

107
00:08:51,340 --> 00:08:52,610
What in the world happened?

108
00:09:07,520 --> 00:09:08,920
What the hell is that?

109
00:09:10,730 --> 00:09:12,530
If it's that big this far away...

110
00:09:12,990 --> 00:09:15,700
It's gotta be twice as big
as the Colossal Titan.

111
00:09:16,320 --> 00:09:17,880
The wall won't stand a chance...

112
00:09:18,780 --> 00:09:19,780
Commander?

113
00:09:20,740 --> 00:09:21,950
Advance!

114
00:09:31,920 --> 00:09:32,920
Eren!

115
00:09:35,010 --> 00:09:36,010
Eren!

116
00:09:38,050 --> 00:09:39,180
Eren!

117
00:09:43,220 --> 00:09:44,220
Eren!

118
00:10:05,790 --> 00:10:07,490
That's what I call hardening.

119
00:10:08,540 --> 00:10:12,990
Even after cutting you away,
the Titan hasn't disappeared.

120
00:10:13,920 --> 00:10:15,550
Pretty impressive, yeah?

121
00:10:20,550 --> 00:10:21,930
That bottle...

122
00:10:22,430 --> 00:10:27,350
Oh, yeah! Right before I turned into
a Titan, I drank that "Armor" bottle...

123
00:10:27,600 --> 00:10:28,600
Yeah.

124
00:10:29,190 --> 00:10:33,170
You couldn't do it at all before now,
but you used the hardening power.

125
00:10:33,650 --> 00:10:34,940
And saved all of us.

126
00:10:35,860 --> 00:10:40,200
In the blink of an eye,
you devised and built all this.

127
00:10:40,990 --> 00:10:46,790
Yeah, the construction looks shoddy, but...
I bet that's how the walls were made, too.

128
00:10:48,000 --> 00:10:49,000
In other words...

129
00:10:50,870 --> 00:10:54,500
It's possible for us to plug
that hole in Wall Maria now.

130
00:10:56,090 --> 00:10:58,669
A lot of enemies and allies
have died on the way,

131
00:10:58,670 --> 00:11:01,510
and getting this far hasn't been pretty,

132
00:11:02,260 --> 00:11:06,270
but for as ugly as it's been,
look at the position we're in now.

133
00:11:08,230 --> 00:11:09,910
Retaking Wall Maria...

134
00:11:10,390 --> 00:11:13,880
Once we do that,
we can investigate my basement.

135
00:11:14,690 --> 00:11:17,280
But, my dad was actually...

136
00:11:24,490 --> 00:11:25,490
Captain!

137
00:11:26,700 --> 00:11:28,450
We've secured an exit!

138
00:11:29,160 --> 00:11:30,370
Armin's safe!

139
00:11:30,870 --> 00:11:32,620
Hange and Moblit, too!

140
00:11:33,380 --> 00:11:34,380
Well done.

141
00:11:34,790 --> 00:11:35,790
Eren!

142
00:11:36,170 --> 00:11:37,170
You okay?

143
00:11:38,050 --> 00:11:40,170
We're all safe, thanks to you!

144
00:11:40,590 --> 00:11:45,969
But to be perfectly honest, when you ran
off prancing while crying like a baby...

145
00:11:45,970 --> 00:11:47,679
...I thought we were doomed!

146
00:11:47,680 --> 00:11:50,853
"It's over, over! Get it
together, nincompoop!

147
00:11:50,878 --> 00:11:53,364
Quit bawling like a
snotty-nosed brat!"

148
00:11:53,650 --> 00:11:55,189
is what I thought.

149
00:11:55,190 --> 00:11:56,190
Hey...

150
00:11:57,650 --> 00:11:58,650
Let's go.

151
00:11:58,980 --> 00:12:01,110
We're going after that big-ass Titan.

152
00:12:03,610 --> 00:12:04,610
Eren!

153
00:12:36,020 --> 00:12:38,799
It's no use! Stay back! We'll get burnt!

154
00:12:38,800 --> 00:12:41,859
Commander, we can't stop it!

155
00:12:41,860 --> 00:12:44,530
It's like an Abnormal and
doesn't care about us!

156
00:12:44,820 --> 00:12:46,260
Enough! Fall back!

157
00:12:46,660 --> 00:12:50,440
All that matters for now is to find
out the direction it's heading.

158
00:12:50,870 --> 00:12:52,980
Commander Erwin! It's Squad Levi!

159
00:12:54,210 --> 00:12:57,050
Eren and Historia are with them!
They succeeded!

160
00:13:03,550 --> 00:13:04,550
Erwin.

161
00:13:06,180 --> 00:13:07,240
Everyone all right?

162
00:13:07,800 --> 00:13:09,890
Hange's our only casualty.

163
00:13:11,810 --> 00:13:13,490
Seems like nothing too serious.

164
00:13:14,140 --> 00:13:16,150
Well done, everyone.

165
00:13:16,560 --> 00:13:19,590
I've got a whole slew of things
to report, but first...

166
00:13:19,940 --> 00:13:20,940
What's that Titan?

167
00:13:21,860 --> 00:13:22,900
It's Rod Reiss.

168
00:13:24,780 --> 00:13:28,360
I think we'll need your
call on this, Commander.

169
00:13:33,330 --> 00:13:36,430
Regardless, we don't have time
to stand here and chat.

170
00:13:37,040 --> 00:13:38,360
Return to Wall Sina.

171
00:13:38,960 --> 00:13:42,380
You're going to let that big ass
crawl right up to the wall?

172
00:13:43,130 --> 00:13:44,920
To Orvud District, actually.

173
00:13:45,510 --> 00:13:47,890
That's most likely where it's headed.

174
00:14:16,210 --> 00:14:17,790
Let's put this all together...

175
00:14:18,960 --> 00:14:25,420
Basically, Rod Reiss was after the Founding
Titan, the Titan power inside Eren.

176
00:14:26,420 --> 00:14:31,480
However, unless it's in someone with Reiss
blood, you won't get its true potential.

177
00:14:32,300 --> 00:14:37,349
Though, even if a Reiss obtains
the Founding Titan's power,

178
00:14:37,350 --> 00:14:40,235
they're controlled by the
First King's will and

179
00:14:40,260 --> 00:14:42,964
refuse to liberate
humanity from the Titans.

180
00:14:44,400 --> 00:14:47,460
Eh? Well, isn't that interesting...

181
00:14:48,200 --> 00:14:51,710
According to the First
King, this is true peace?

182
00:14:52,280 --> 00:14:54,830
Now that's a weird way to look at it.

183
00:14:56,160 --> 00:15:00,080
In other words... we still have an option.

184
00:15:01,000 --> 00:15:05,520
If that Titan eats me,
Rod Reiss will return to a human.

185
00:15:06,210 --> 00:15:10,190
Which means it's still possible
to have a true Founding Titan.

186
00:15:11,050 --> 00:15:12,180
You can't...

187
00:15:12,800 --> 00:15:14,300
Seems that way.

188
00:15:15,760 --> 00:15:18,540
We could capture Rod Reiss
once he becomes a human.

189
00:15:18,890 --> 00:15:20,870
Undo the First King's brainwashing.

190
00:15:21,310 --> 00:15:25,570
If we could do that, it might open
a path to save humanity.

191
00:15:27,740 --> 00:15:28,920
Plus, Eren...

192
00:15:29,820 --> 00:15:32,960
Are you saying you're fully
prepared to let that happen?

193
00:15:35,910 --> 00:15:36,910
I am.

194
00:15:40,500 --> 00:15:42,830
Eren, you can't...

195
00:15:44,210 --> 00:15:46,280
You're forgetting our other option.

196
00:15:47,710 --> 00:15:51,220
First of all, the current
plan is full of flaws.

197
00:15:51,880 --> 00:15:56,380
One, there's no proof that you can
undo Rod Reiss' brainwashing.

198
00:15:57,430 --> 00:16:01,940
No matter how you restrain him, if he
alters humanity's memories, it's over.

199
00:16:02,900 --> 00:16:07,890
Basically, there's too many factors about
the Founding Titan that we just don't know.

200
00:16:08,530 --> 00:16:09,530
True...

201
00:16:10,280 --> 00:16:18,040
Even if Rod Reiss eats Eren, we have
no guarantee that he'll return to normal.

202
00:16:18,370 --> 00:16:19,370
Mmm.

203
00:16:20,160 --> 00:16:23,919
On the other hand, all we've ever
known is destructive pacifists.

204
00:16:23,920 --> 00:16:27,419
But as it stands, the Founding Titan
was taken from them.

205
00:16:27,420 --> 00:16:30,140
This is a once in a lifetime
chance for humanity.

206
00:16:31,760 --> 00:16:32,760
Yes...

207
00:16:33,130 --> 00:16:37,570
Your father was trying to save us
and humanity from the First King.

208
00:16:39,520 --> 00:16:42,229
He stole the Founding
Titan from my sister...

209
00:16:42,230 --> 00:16:44,770
...murdered all of the Reiss children...

210
00:16:45,350 --> 00:16:47,580
...because he had no other choice.

211
00:16:50,480 --> 00:16:54,529
If you want to save Mikasa,
Armin, and everyone else...

212
00:16:54,530 --> 00:16:58,410
...you must learn to control this ability!

213
00:17:00,290 --> 00:17:01,450
Dad...

214
00:17:02,160 --> 00:17:03,180
That's right!

215
00:17:03,500 --> 00:17:08,090
The Dr. Jaeger I know wouldn't do
something like that for no reason at all.

216
00:17:08,340 --> 00:17:13,290
Right. Even without having Reiss blood,
there must be a way to save humanity.

217
00:17:13,720 --> 00:17:16,340
That's why he left you
the key to the basement.

218
00:17:21,140 --> 00:17:22,599
What basement?

219
00:17:22,600 --> 00:17:26,599
Oh, that whole thing?
You mean it's actually important?

220
00:17:26,600 --> 00:17:27,980
Uh, yeah...

221
00:17:28,190 --> 00:17:31,310
We've finally got a way
to plug up the wall.

222
00:17:32,360 --> 00:17:34,740
The way I see it, there's only one choice.

223
00:17:35,570 --> 00:17:37,910
That makes life a little easier.

224
00:17:39,490 --> 00:17:42,270
If it means anything, I
agree with that choice.

225
00:17:42,700 --> 00:17:45,220
Though, are you sure about this, Historia?

226
00:17:45,710 --> 00:17:50,760
We can't exactly have a Titan like that
wandering around inside the walls.

227
00:17:51,630 --> 00:17:53,820
One that big, we can't restrain.

228
00:17:54,920 --> 00:17:55,920
Meaning...

229
00:17:58,430 --> 00:18:01,180
We'll have to kill your father
and there's no way around it.

230
00:18:23,950 --> 00:18:24,950
Eren.

231
00:18:25,290 --> 00:18:26,340
I'm sorry.

232
00:18:27,000 --> 00:18:28,000
Eh?

233
00:18:29,120 --> 00:18:30,700
Underneath the Reiss chapel...

234
00:18:31,250 --> 00:18:35,460
...I really considered becoming
a Titan and killing you.

235
00:18:36,840 --> 00:18:40,120
What's more, not even to save humanity...

236
00:18:41,100 --> 00:18:43,790
Only because I wanted to believe my father.

237
00:18:45,270 --> 00:18:48,370
I didn't want my father to hate me...

238
00:18:54,360 --> 00:18:56,630
But now, it's time to say goodbye.

239
00:19:03,580 --> 00:19:06,540
"Orvud District - Regiment Branch"

240
00:19:15,340 --> 00:19:17,450
Please gather your squad in the hall.

241
00:19:18,050 --> 00:19:20,200
The strategy meeting is about to begin.

242
00:19:20,800 --> 00:19:21,800
All right.

243
00:19:23,600 --> 00:19:26,170
Historia. Forgot to tell you...

244
00:19:27,020 --> 00:19:28,760
We need you to do something.

245
00:19:29,270 --> 00:19:30,270
Yes?

246
00:19:32,940 --> 00:19:34,450
Erwin's orders.

247
00:19:35,190 --> 00:19:39,859
When this battle is over, since you're
the true successor to the throne...

248
00:19:39,860 --> 00:19:40,980
...become the Queen.

249
00:19:41,570 --> 00:19:42,280
Eh?

250
00:19:42,530 --> 00:19:43,410
Huh?

251
00:19:43,411 --> 00:19:46,360
Q-Queen?! Historia?!

252
00:19:46,790 --> 00:19:48,414
The coup d'etat was successful,

253
00:19:48,439 --> 00:19:52,024
but the people won't follow a
regiment sitting at the top.

254
00:19:52,460 --> 00:19:54,839
What we need is a story to spread.

255
00:19:54,840 --> 00:19:58,600
That a true heir retook
the crown from the fake.

256
00:19:59,920 --> 00:20:01,000
I...

257
00:20:03,890 --> 00:20:05,510
Um, Captain?

258
00:20:05,850 --> 00:20:09,269
I'm sure you heard what
Historia said earlier, but...

259
00:20:09,270 --> 00:20:10,590
Well, uh...

260
00:20:11,100 --> 00:20:12,563
By leaving her father,

261
00:20:12,588 --> 00:20:17,284
she finally broke free from that
burden, I guess you could say...

262
00:20:17,570 --> 00:20:19,109
And yet, again...

263
00:20:19,110 --> 00:20:20,110
What?

264
00:20:20,440 --> 00:20:22,449
If you have something to say, say it.

265
00:20:22,450 --> 00:20:23,650
Uh, um...

266
00:20:24,070 --> 00:20:25,310
I-In other words...

267
00:20:26,160 --> 00:20:28,119
Conny's trying to say...

268
00:20:28,120 --> 00:20:33,250
Historia broke free from the Reiss
family and has finally found herself.

269
00:20:33,870 --> 00:20:38,210
And now you're forcing her
into another role? Isn't that...?

270
00:20:39,250 --> 00:20:41,469
Isn't that... not fair to her?

271
00:20:41,470 --> 00:20:42,420
All right.

272
00:20:42,420 --> 00:20:43,420
Eh?

273
00:20:44,010 --> 00:20:46,390
My next duty is to be Queen, right?

274
00:20:47,220 --> 00:20:48,370
Understood.

275
00:20:49,470 --> 00:20:50,720
Historia...

276
00:20:51,680 --> 00:20:53,450
Thanks for your concern.

277
00:20:54,100 --> 00:21:00,730
But whether or not it's forced on me
is up to me to decide, I think.

278
00:21:02,280 --> 00:21:03,280
However...

279
00:21:04,070 --> 00:21:07,120
Captain, I do have one condition.

280
00:21:07,700 --> 00:21:08,700
Hmm?

281
00:21:09,450 --> 00:21:13,330
Since my fate is my own,
I want to lay it all on the line.

282
00:21:24,050 --> 00:21:26,830
When you're Queen,
you can punch that runt in the face.

283
00:21:29,850 --> 00:21:32,519
We've determined the location
of Rod Reiss' Titan.

284
00:21:32,520 --> 00:21:34,320
It's southwest, approaching Orvud.

285
00:21:34,730 --> 00:21:38,140
At this rate, it should reach
Orvud District by dawn.

286
00:21:38,520 --> 00:21:39,570
Understood.

287
00:21:39,980 --> 00:21:43,690
Commander Erwin, we'd all
like to hear what your plan is.

288
00:21:44,400 --> 00:21:47,060
How do you intend to evacuate
the citizens in time?

289
00:21:47,660 --> 00:21:48,910
We won't evacuate.

290
00:21:49,580 --> 00:21:50,580
Wh-What?

291
00:21:51,240 --> 00:21:54,990
We'll have the citizens remain in
Orvud District just as they are.

292
00:21:55,210 --> 00:21:56,709
Uh...

293
00:21:56,710 --> 00:21:58,180
Are you insane?

294
00:23:40,640 --> 00:23:45,330
At Orvud District, Eren and the others
face off against Rod Reiss' Titan.

295
00:23:46,070 --> 00:23:50,860
Meanwhile, Historia is determined
to decide her own fate.

296
00:23:51,610 --> 00:23:54,140
Next episode: "Ruler of the Walls."

297
00:23:54,240 --> 00:23:56,089
"Ruler of the Walls"
